msgid "Enrollment"
msgstr "Pendaftaran"

msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Perilaku"

msgid "Face authentication"
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah"

msgid "Face authentication for unlocking this session. This does not affect the GDM login screen (see below). Settings are stored in your current dconf profile."
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah untuk membuka kunci sesi ini. Ini tidak memengaruhi layar login GDM (lihat di bawah). Pengaturan disimpan di profil dconf Anda saat ini."

msgid "Enable face authentication (lock screen)"
msgstr "Aktifkan autentikasi wajah (layar kunci)"

msgid "Face retry mode"
msgstr "Mode percobaan ulang wajah"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Dinonaktifkan"

msgid "Fixed tries"
msgstr "Jumlah percobaan tetap"

msgid "Infinite"
msgstr "Tidak terbatas"

msgid "Maximum face tries"
msgstr "Percobaan wajah maksimum"

msgid "Enrolled faces"
msgstr "Wajah terdaftar"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "Memeriksa…"

msgid "Open Gaze"
msgstr "Buka Gaze"

msgid "Could not open the Gaze app. Run gaze-gui from a terminal."
msgstr "Tidak dapat membuka aplikasi Gaze. Jalankan gaze-gui dari terminal."

msgid "A face is enrolled for this account."
msgstr "Wajah telah terdaftar untuk akun ini."

msgid "No face is enrolled yet, so face unlock has nothing to match. Open Gaze to enroll one."
msgstr "Belum ada wajah yang terdaftar, sehingga buka kunci wajah tidak memiliki pembanding. Buka Gaze untuk mendaftarkannya."

msgid "Gaze daemon unavailable."
msgstr "Layanan Gaze tidak tersedia."

msgid "GDM login screen"
msgstr "Layar login GDM"

msgid "Enable face authentication at the GDM login screen. Requires administrator authorization. Note: GNOME keyring is normally unlocked by your password, so logging in with face only may leave it locked."
msgstr "Aktifkan autentikasi wajah di layar login GDM. Memerlukan otorisasi administrator. Catatan: keyring GNOME biasanya dibuka dengan kata sandi Anda, sehingga login hanya dengan wajah dapat membuatnya tetap terkunci."

msgid "Enable face authentication at GDM login"
msgstr "Aktifkan autentikasi wajah saat login GDM"

msgid "Administrator authorization is required to enable face authentication at the GDM login screen."
msgstr "Otorisasi administrator diperlukan untuk mengaktifkan autentikasi wajah di layar login GDM."

msgid "Administrator authorization is required to disable face authentication at the GDM login screen."
msgstr "Otorisasi administrator diperlukan untuk menonaktifkan autentikasi wajah di layar login GDM."

msgid "Could not update GDM login face authentication: {error}"
msgstr "Tidak dapat memperbarui autentikasi wajah untuk login GDM: {error}"

msgid "Face auth enabled at the GDM login screen. Restart GDM (or reboot) for it to take effect."
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah diaktifkan di layar login GDM. Mulai ulang GDM (atau komputer) agar berlaku."

msgid "Face auth disabled at the GDM login screen. Restart GDM (or reboot) for it to take effect."
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah dinonaktifkan di layar login GDM. Mulai ulang GDM (atau komputer) agar berlaku."

msgid "Face not recognized. Please enter your password."
msgstr "Wajah tidak dikenali. Masukkan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Face not detected. Please enter your password."
msgstr "Wajah tidak terdeteksi. Masukkan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Too dark for face authentication. Please enter your password."
msgstr "Terlalu gelap untuk autentikasi wajah. Masukkan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Face authentication timed out. Please enter your password."
msgstr "Waktu autentikasi wajah habis. Masukkan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Face authentication unavailable. Please enter your password."
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah tidak tersedia. Masukkan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Changing Gaze's settings or faces needs your password."
msgstr "Mengubah pengaturan atau wajah Gaze memerlukan kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Sorry, face authentication did not work. Please try again."
msgstr "Maaf, autentikasi wajah tidak berhasil. Silakan coba lagi."

msgid "You reached the maximum face authentication attempts, please try another method"
msgstr "Anda telah mencapai batas maksimum percobaan autentikasi wajah, silakan coba cara lain"

msgid "(or look at the camera)"
msgstr "(atau lihat ke kamera)"

msgid "(or look at the camera or swipe finger)"
msgstr "(atau lihat ke kamera atau usap jari)"

msgid "(or look at the camera or place finger on reader)"
msgstr "(atau lihat ke kamera atau letakkan jari pada pembaca)"

msgid "(or swipe finger across reader)"
msgstr "(atau usap jari melintasi pembaca)"

msgid "(or place finger on reader)"
msgstr "(atau letakkan jari pada pembaca)"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Kata sandi"

msgid "Face verified. Press Enter or click Authenticate to confirm."
msgstr "Wajah terverifikasi. Tekan Enter atau klik Autentikasi untuk mengonfirmasi."

msgid "Face authentication failed"
msgstr "Autentikasi wajah gagal"

msgid "Confirm Face Unlock"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Buka Kunci Wajah"

msgid "Failed to show confirmation prompt"
msgstr "Gagal menampilkan permintaan konfirmasi"

msgid "Please look at the camera..."
msgstr "Silakan lihat ke kamera…"

msgid "Need more light..."
msgstr "Perlu lebih banyak cahaya…"

msgid "Face is clipped. Please move back..."
msgstr "Wajah terpotong. Silakan mundur…"

msgid "Please center your face..."
msgstr "Posisikan wajah Anda di tengah…"

msgid "Please come closer..."
msgstr "Silakan mendekat…"

msgid "Please back up..."
msgstr "Silakan mundur…"

msgid "Hold still..."
msgstr "Jangan bergerak…"
